{"server":"jp","storyId":"story_rope_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_rope_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"フラワーパフューム","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_rope_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"7cba3ed52654d1b423d2a76dc847c424d2e1f23a701f4c0035c8702ea717cbb9","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"ロープが療養庭園へとやってきた。パフューマーを見つける前に、彼女は庭園内の植物に気を引かれるのだった。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"a.m. 10:30 天気/晴天\nロドス本艦 四号船室 療養庭園"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"お邪魔しま～す。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"すいませ～ん！　誰かいませんか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"ん？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"……ありゃ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"誰もいないの？　こーんにーちはー！　誰かー、いませんかー！　ハロー！！　いないのー！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"うわ、本当に誰もいないっぽい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"これは困ったな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"フフンッ、せっかく来たのに、手ぶらで帰るなんてぼくの主義に反するね。龍門の凄腕ロープ様が見てやろう。ここにはどんなお宝があるのかな……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"……って、いやいや、ダメでしょ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"（顔を叩く）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"やめろ、やめるんだロープ。もうこんなことしちゃダメだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"（何度か顔を叩く）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"はぁ、習慣って怖いなあ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"でもさ、誰もいないのに鍵をかけてないとか、不用心にもほどがあるよね。何か盗られても文句は言えないよ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"ぼくは何も取らないから、ちょっとだけ、何があるのか覗くくらいはいいよね……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"どれどれ？　お宝はあるかな～。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"んん？　地面のこれは……何だろう？　よくわかんないな。まあいいや、怪しいものに近寄るのはやめよう！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"へえ、この花は綺麗な色だね。どれくらいの値打ちなんだろう？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"おぉ、ここの設備、珍しいのを使っているんだね。きっと高いんだろうなぁ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"それとこれは……薬草かな？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"ん？　んん？　うわぁ何、すっごく強烈なこの匂い！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"なんかクラクラするよ……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"ふぅ――はぁ、危なかった！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"危うく気を失うところだったよ。これはヤバい……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門の金庫はこじ開けても開けっ放しの扉には突っ込むなって先輩が言ってたわけだ。まさにその通りだね。先人の言葉は馬鹿にできないね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"さてと、冗談はここまでにして、と。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"誰もいないなら仕方ないか。せっかくだから何かいたずらくらいはして帰りたいけど、怒られてもいやだしね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"また今度――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"ん？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"えっ、こそこそしてるのは、ぼくだけじゃない？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"へへ、どこのコソ泥かな？　ちょっと勝負しよっか～。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"こっそりこそこそこっそりこそこそ……さてとお手並み拝見。鉤縄を準備して――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パフューマー","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"朝露、ミント、スムージー♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パフューマー","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"夕日、ジャスミン、ハチミツの花～♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"あの――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パフューマー","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"フフン～フン～フフフン～。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"あの、すいませ～ん。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パフューマー","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"成長剤をもう少しだけ……うん、このくらいで大丈夫ね！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"あらら、集中しちゃってるよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パフューマー","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"それからこっちの深いところの土を混ぜて、うーん、それか草木灰をもっと足そうかしら？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パフューマー","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"うん、これが良さそうね！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"（本気で気が付いてないの？　危機管理意識が足りなくない？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"（コソ泥と間違えちゃったじゃないか……はぁ。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パフューマー","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"んー……バランスがちょっと悪いわね。以前も不安定だったし。どうしようかしら？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パフューマー","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"――泥炭、赤玉土……弱酸性を保って……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"（ずっと独り言言ってるよこの人。本当に大丈夫なのかな？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"（まぁ、そばで見てるのも、それはそれで結構楽しいし～。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パフューマー","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パフューマー","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"そう！　どうして忘れてたのかしら！　もともと生えてた場所から持ち帰った土を加えてみよう！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パフューマー","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"うんうん、植物だろうと人だろうと、自分の慣れ親しんだものが一番合うはずよね！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"（確かに、それはそうだよね。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"（でも、やっとの思いで飛び出して、家に帰りたくない人もいるんだよね。あれ？　人？　植物？　まあどっちでもいいか……きっとそういう人だってたくさんいるよね？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パフューマー","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"あら、私ったらあの土、どこに置いたかしら？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パフューマー","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"ここではない……ここでもない。んー、どこだったかしら？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パフューマー","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"えっ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"えっ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パフューマー","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パフューマー","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"うわっ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"えっ？　えっ？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロープ","speakerId":"char_236_rope","isRemote":false,"text":"な、なに？　どうしたの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パフューマー","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"え？　あっ……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パフューマー","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"ロープ……さん？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_181_flower","aliases":["パフューマー"]},{"speakerId":"char_236_rope","aliases":["ロープ"]}]}
